{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/unity.mac.plugin.UnityMacPlugin\/documentation\/UnityMacPlugin"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"High‑level Unity bridge for macOS dialog presentation built on top of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/unitymacplugin\/unitymacplugin"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/unitymacplugin\/unitymacplugin"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/unity.mac.plugin.UnityMacPlugin\/documentation\/UnityMacPlugin\/UnityMacPlugin"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacPlugin"},{"text":" exposes the dialog and file panel functionality implemented in the Swift","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/MacDialogManager"},{"text":" to Unity (C#) or other native layers through a thin","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Objective‑C \/ C bridge. It handles:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Alert dialogs (","type":"text"},{"code":"UnityMacDialogManager\/showDialog(title:message:buttonsJson:optionsJson:completion:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Single & multi file pickers (open panels)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Single & multi folder pickers","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Save file dialogs"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Suppression checkbox state reporting","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JSON → Swift option translation for alert configuration"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Safe marshaling of results back to Unity via C function callbacks"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Architecture","level":3,"anchor":"Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacDialogManager"},{"type":"text","text":" wraps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/MacDialogManager"},{"type":"text","text":" and converts strongly typed Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completions into Objective‑C friendly "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(NSDictionary?, NSError?)"},{"type":"text","text":" callbacks. The C bridge functions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(defined in "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UnityMacDialogManagerBridge.h \/ .m"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") further flatten those into plain C primitives so they can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumed with P\/Invoke ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[DllImport(\"__Internal\")]"},{"type":"text","text":") from Unity C# code. A managed helper ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacDialogManager"},{"type":"text","text":" C# MonoBehaviour)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exposes idiomatic events, performs marshaling, and handles memory cleanup."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Layering:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Unity C# (MacDialogManager.cs)","   ↓ (P\/Invoke \/ DllImport)","C Bridge (UnityMacDialogManagerBridge.*)","   ↓ (Objective‑C → Swift)","UnityMacDialogManager (Swift facade)","   ↓","MacDialogManager (Core logic)","   ↓","AppKit (NSAlert \/ NSOpenPanel \/ NSSavePanel)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Result Dictionaries","level":3,"anchor":"Result-Dictionaries"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each dialog type returns a dictionary with well‑defined keys (all values are Foundation bridged types):"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dialog Type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Keys","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alert"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"buttonTitle:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"buttonIndex:Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"suppressionButtonState:Bool","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File \/ MultiFile \/ Folder \/ MultiFolder"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"filePaths:[String]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"fileCount:Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"directoryURL:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"isCancelled:Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess:Bool"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Save","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"filePath:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"fileCount:Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"directoryURL:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"isCancelled:Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess:Bool"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error cases provide an "},{"code":"NSError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"code":"localizedDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" mirrors "},{"code":"MacLibrary\/DialogError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" text."}]},{"level":3,"text":"Cancellation Semantics","anchor":"Cancellation-Semantics","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellation is reported as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isCancelled == true"},{"type":"text","text":" while still treating the operation as logically successful ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess == true"},{"text":")—it is a user choice, not a failure. Runtime issues (configuration errors, unexpected failures) set ","type":"text"},{"code":"isSuccess == false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and provide an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Alert JSON Schema","anchor":"Alert-JSON-Schema","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"buttonsJson","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" example:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"buttons\": [","    { \"title\": \"OK\", \"isDefault\": true, \"keyEquivalent\": \"\" },","    { \"title\": \"Cancel\" }","  ]","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"optionsJson"},{"type":"text","text":" example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"alertStyle\": \"warning\",","  \"showsSuppressionButton\": true,","  \"suppressionButtonTitle\": \"Do not show again\"","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alertStyle"},{"text":" accepts: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"informational"},{"text":" | ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"warning"},{"text":" | ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"critical"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"File--Folder-Selection","text":"File & Folder Selection"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File filters are passed as an array of filename extensions (no leading dot) and converted to ","type":"text"},{"code":"UTType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s in Swift. Folder dialogs disable file selection flags and invert selection logic accordingly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Save-Panel","text":"Save Panel"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The save dialog returns a single path. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fileCount"},{"text":" remains for structural symmetry (1 on success, 0 if cancelled).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Threading","text":"Threading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All public functions are safe to call from any thread. UI work is dispatched onto the main queue by the underlying manager. The C# wrapper enqueues callbacks back to Unity’s main thread (via a dispatcher) before firing events.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Memory--Lifetime-Notes","text":"Memory & Lifetime Notes"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"C callback string pointers reference autoreleased NSStrings valid only during the execution of the callback. The Unity C# wrapper copies them (","type":"text"},{"code":"Marshal.PtrToStringUTF8","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") into managed strings immediately. Caller code only receives safe managed data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Unity C# Wrapper (MacDialogManager.cs)","anchor":"Unity-C-Wrapper-MacDialogManagercs"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The provided sample "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacDialogManager"},{"type":"text","text":" MonoBehaviour offers:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lazy singleton creation (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Instance"},{"text":" property); object is marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DontDestroyOnLoad"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Event-based result delivery for each dialog type:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AlertDialogResult(string? buttonTitle, int buttonIndex, bool suppressionState, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDialogResult(string[]? filePaths, int fileCount, string? directoryURL, bool isCancelled, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFileDialogResult(…)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"FolderDialogResult(…)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFolderDialogResult(…)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SaveFileDialogResult(string? filePath, int fileCount, string? directoryURL, bool isCancelled, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Validation (title, buttons\/options presence) with early error event emission.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Explicit unmanaged memory allocation & guaranteed release inside callback (even on error) for content type arrays."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Main‑thread dispatch for all event invocations."}]}]}]},{"level":3,"text":"C# Alert Usage","anchor":"C-Alert-Usage","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"csharp","code":["var buttons = new [] {","    new DialogButton { title = \"OK\", isDefault = true },","    new DialogButton { title = \"Cancel\" }","};","var options = new DialogOptions { alertStyle = \"informational\", showsSuppressionButton = true, suppressionButtonTitle = \"Do not show again\" };","MacDialogManager.Instance.AlertDialogResult += (title, index, suppression, success, err) => {","    if (success) Debug.Log($\"Pressed {title} (index {index}) suppression={suppression}\");","    else Debug.LogError(err);","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowDialog(\"Example\", \"Choose an option\", buttons, options);"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"C# Single File Dialog","anchor":"C-Single-File-Dialog","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.FileDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (!success) { Debug.LogError(err); return; }","    if (cancelled) Debug.Log(\"User cancelled\"); else Debug.Log(string.Join(\"\\n\", paths));","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowFileDialog(\"Select File\", \"Pick a single file\", new [] { \"txt\", \"md\" });"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"C# Multi File Dialog","anchor":"C-Multi-File-Dialog","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.MultiFileDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Selected {count} files\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowMultiFileDialog(\"Select Files\", \"Choose multiple\", new [] { \"png\", \"jpg\" });"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"C# Folder & Multi Folder","anchor":"C-Folder--Multi-Folder","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.FolderDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Folder: {paths?[0]}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowFolderDialog(\"Select Folder\", \"Choose a folder\");","","MacDialogManager.Instance.MultiFolderDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Folders: {string.Join(\", \", paths ?? Array.Empty<string>())}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowMultiFolderDialog(\"Select Folders\", \"Choose multiple folders\");"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"C# Save File Dialog","anchor":"C-Save-File-Dialog","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.SaveFileDialogResult += (path, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Save path: {path}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowSaveFileDialog(\"Save File\", \"Provide a location\", \"sample.txt\", new [] { \"txt\" });"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"Events Lifecycle Notes","anchor":"Events-Lifecycle-Notes","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Subscribe ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" invoking the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Show*"},{"text":" method to avoid race conditions if a dialog closes quickly (rare but possible).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unsubscribe when no longer needed to avoid memory leaks in long‑running editor sessions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Multiple listeners are supported; each is invoked sequentially."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"level":2,"text":"C Bridge Mapping","anchor":"C-Bridge-Mapping","type":"heading"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C Function"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C# DllImport Signature (Simplified)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Managed Invoke Method","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Result Event","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"showDialog","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showDialog(string,string,string,string,DialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AlertDialogResult"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showFileDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"void showFil